Value Filldown PROCESS (\d+)
Value Filldown ROUTER_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Filldown AREA (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value PRIORITY (\d+)
Value DEAD_TIME (\S+)
Value STATE ([\w-]+)
Value ROLE (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

# One record per OSPF neighbour under its process and area headers (campus-wan and
# vpn-fabric labs, Comware 7.1). "Full/ -": no DR role on a point-to-point link.
Start
  ^\s*OSPF Process\s -> Continue.Clearall
  ^\s*OSPF Process ${PROCESS} with Router ID ${ROUTER_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*Neighbor Brief Information\s*$$
  ^\s*Area:\s*${AREA}\s*$$
  ^\s*Router ID\s+Address\s+Pri\s+Dead-Time\s+State\s+Interface\s*$$
  ^\s*${NEIGHBOR_ID}\s+${ADDRESS}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${DEAD_TIME}\s+${STATE}/\s*${ROLE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display ospf peer line"
